Description: Implements the masked-likelihood-ratio component of LKOM for
    joint analysis of trajectory-mean and within-subject variability channels
    in longitudinal association studies. The package provides deterministic
    and Gibbs inference engines, swap-symmetric marginal-screen handling,
    knockoff+ selection, four-state association classification, optional
    whitening for related samples, and an interface to a Julia implementation
    of WiSER and TrajGWAS.
